[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0010","text":"羽毛球！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0020","text":"野餐垫……呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0030","text":"啊——！　绝对需要！\n嗯——，玩的东西！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0040","text":"那个有必要吗……？\n纸盘和餐具。百元店的就行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0050","text":"……哇，非常重要……呢\n这样的话，湿纸巾之类的也……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0060","text":"盘子跟湿巾绝对需要！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0070","text":"诶——，我只想到玩的……！\n想玩泡泡水啦，想玩飞盘啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0080","text":"本来就是以玩为主的，那样不就行了\n垃圾袋"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0090","text":"垃圾得带回去才行呢\n……啊，零食……怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300200_03_0100","text":"赞成／赞成——！"}]
